nodes.body:
Hi @yeahdongcn, I don't have an S5000, so what I could verify is on CPU, the regression test in this PR fails on main  and passes with the fix. The change is also equivalent to the two line patch the reporter tested on an S5000 in #46508.

@froststeam has since run it on an S5000 along with #46725 (v0.5.16 backport, Qwen3-8B + EAGLE3, radix cache on), and the repeated cached request completed.

If you'd rather go with #46735, happy to close this one.

